§§ `נספח א' — הדירוגים שההסכם אינו חל עליהם`

-- akn:attachments The annexes' frame: a label row.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 Signatures and initials on the page; no rule.

-- ¶1: the scales the framework does not reach: (1) jurists, (2) public
-- defenders and (3) state attorneys whose pay is linked to a judicial
-- officer's; (4) civil research; (5) veterinary doctors. ¶2: for the
-- avoidance of doubt, nor the State's emissaries abroad paid by the
-- inter-ministerial committee's decision of 24.12.2017, ITN and ITN
-- security employees paid by its decision of 3.2.2019, or an ITN employee
-- who is a spouse of an emissary and chose the scale "חוזה שכר אית"ן בן
-- זוג" (Shutash 2.2.1.3), each as updated from time to time.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2
`the annex א' scales of 2023 that leave out one linked to a judicial officer` MEANS
    LIST "משפטנים", "סנגור ציבורי", "פרקליטים"

`the annex א' scales of 2023 left out whole` MEANS
    LIST "המחקר האזרחי", "רופאים וטרינרים", "שליחי המדינה בחו\"ל", "אית\"ן", "אית\"ן אבטחה", "חוזה שכר אית\"ן בן זוג"

GIVEN e IS A `2023 framework employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in a scale annex א' of 2023 keeps out` e IF
        elem (e's `his scale under the 2023 framework`) `the annex א' scales of 2023 left out whole`
    OR (    elem (e's `his scale under the 2023 framework`) `the annex א' scales of 2023 that leave out one linked to a judicial officer`
        AND e's `his pay is linked to a judicial officer's under the 2023 framework`)

`a State jurist of 2023` MEANS
    `2023 framework employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE "משפטנים" FALSE

`a State jurist of 2023 linked to a judicial officer` MEANS
    `2023 framework employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE "משפטנים" TRUE

-- The teaching scale is not the Histadrut's.
`a State teacher of 2023` MEANS
    `2023 framework employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE "עובדי הוראה" FALSE

#ASSERT `the 2023 framework agreement covers` `a State jurist of 2023`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2023 framework agreement covers` `a State jurist of 2023 linked to a judicial officer`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2023 framework agreement covers` `a State teacher of 2023`

§§ `נספח ב'1 — כתב הצטרפות`

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 The letter's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1/p1 "To"; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1/p2 The chief labour-relations officer; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1/p3 The Ministry of Economy and Industry; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1/p4 The subject line: joining the framework of 17.7.2023; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_3/p2 A blank for the date; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_3/p3 A blank for the signature on the employer's behalf; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_3/p4 Signatures and initials on the page; no rule.

-- ¶2: an employer may sign it that meets all of these: (1) it is a
-- "funded" or "supported" body (Budget Foundations Law); (2) either (א) it
-- has no wage agreement for 1.1.2020 to the end of the framework's period,
-- or one for part of it of no more than 6 months, or (ב) it has one for
-- part of it of more than 6 months and it was agreed, on the eve of the
-- framework's signing, that beside it the framework's updates reach it for
-- that time or part of it; (3) it was not set that it has no right to a
-- proportional part of the frameworks' rates, or no update by them, for
-- part of that time; (4) it is not an employer of annex ב'2 as to the
-- employees listed there.
@desc An employer, as far as annex ב'1 asks.
DECLARE `2023 joining employer` HAS
    `a funded or supported body under 2023` IS A BOOLEAN
    `months of its wage agreement in 1.1.2020–31.12.2027` IS A NUMBER
    `agreed on the eve that the framework's updates reach it too` IS A BOOLEAN
    `set to have no share of the frameworks' rates for part of the time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in annex ב'2 for the employees in question` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_a akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_b akn:att_2__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_4
GIVEN j IS A `2023 joining employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an employer may sign annex ב'1 of 2023` j IF
        j's `a funded or supported body under 2023`
    AND (   j's `months of its wage agreement in 1.1.2020–31.12.2027` AT MOST 6
         OR j's `agreed on the eve that the framework's updates reach it too`)
    AND NOT j's `set to have no share of the frameworks' rates for part of the time`
    AND NOT j's `in annex ב'2 for the employees in question`

#ASSERT `an employer may sign annex ב'1 of 2023` (`2023 joining employer` TRUE 6 FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `an employer may sign annex ב'1 of 2023` (`2023 joining employer` TRUE 7 FALSE FALSE FALSE)

-- The letter, ¶5: the employer joins for its employees annex ב'2 does not
-- list. (1) It joins every provision, as a whole, by each section's reach;
-- payments are due from their own start days, retroactively where it joins
-- later. (2) But it applies the agreed shortening from the first of the
-- month after it joins: (א) joining after the first pulse and by the end
-- of January 2024, it brings the second pulse forward by the months the
-- first was put off; (ב) joining from February 2024, it applies both pulses
-- on the first of the month after joining, and the follow-up committee
-- decides an economically equivalent arrangement for chapter יד(1). (3)
-- For employees agreed on the eve to have the coming framework's
-- supplements, or updates at future frameworks' rates ("ההסכמות
-- הקודמות"), the payments under the framework carry those out in full for
-- its period: no further claim or negotiation, and never a double payment.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_1
`a joining employer pays from the framework's own start days, retroactively` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_a akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN `the month it joined` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month a joiner of 2023 shortens the week from` `the month it joined` IS
    `the month it joined` PLUS 1

-- A joiner of December 2023 starts the first pulse in January 2024, three
-- months after 1.10.2023, and brings the second three months forward from
-- 1.9.2024, to June 2024.
GIVEN `the month it joined` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month a joiner of 2023 takes the second pulse` `the month it joined` IS
    IF `the month it joined` AT LEAST `the 2023 framework's month` 2024 2
    THEN `the month a joiner of 2023 shortens the week from` `the month it joined`
    ELSE IF `the month a joiner of 2023 shortens the week from` `the month it joined` GREATER THAN `the 2023 framework's month` 2023 10
         THEN `the 2023 framework's month` 2024 9 MINUS (`the month a joiner of 2023 shortens the week from` `the month it joined` MINUS `the 2023 framework's month` 2023 10)
         ELSE `the 2023 framework's month` 2024 9

#ASSERT `the month a joiner of 2023 takes the second pulse` (`the 2023 framework's month` 2023 12) EQUALS `the 2023 framework's month` 2024 6
#ASSERT `the month a joiner of 2023 takes the second pulse` (`the 2023 framework's month` 2024 3) EQUALS `the 2023 framework's month` 2024 4

@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_3
`the framework's payments carry out the earlier understandings in full` MEANS TRUE

§§ `נספחים ב'2 ו־ב'3 — מעסיקים שאינם יכולים לחתום על ב'1`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p4 Signatures and initials on the page; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 The letter's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 "To"; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p4 The chief labour-relations officer; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 The Ministry of Economy and Industry; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p6 The subject line: joining chapter יד of the framework of 17.7.2023; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p13 Signatures and initials on the page; no rule.

-- ב'2 ¶1: the employers that cannot sign annex ב'1 for the employees it
-- lists and may join chapter יד by annex ב'3; ¶2: the annex adds to or
-- takes from no linkage to the frameworks those bodies have; ¶3: an
-- employer that cannot join for the employees in the left column may join
-- for its others.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1/t1 akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1/p3
`annex ב'2 of 2023 changes a body's linkage to the frameworks` MEANS FALSE

-- ב'3 ¶2: an employer may sign it that (1) is a funded or supported body,
-- (2) cannot join by annex ב'1 for some or all of its employees, and (3)
-- whose employees meet §62(א). The letter, ¶7: it joins chapter יד for its
-- employees annex ב'2 lists; ¶8: as a whole; ¶9: the pulses' days of
-- §63(ב) do not reach the time before the month after it signs; ¶10: and
-- §§98 and 102, and no others; ¶11: it joins only what it names; ¶12: it
-- approves no pay deviation under §29.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3
GIVEN `a funded or supported body` IS A BOOLEAN, `cannot join by ב'1` IS A BOOLEAN, `its employees meet §62(א)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an employer may sign annex ב'3 of 2023` `a funded or supported body` `cannot join by ב'1` `its employees meet §62(א)` IF
    `a funded or supported body` AND `cannot join by ב'1` AND `its employees meet §62(א)`

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p7 akn:att_4__hc_1/p8 akn:att_4__hc_1/p10 akn:att_4__hc_1/p11
`what annex ב'3 of 2023 joins` MEANS LIST "יד", "98", "102"

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p9
GIVEN `the month it signed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first month a ב'3 joiner's pulses reach` `the month it signed` IS
    `the month it signed` PLUS 1

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p12
`annex ב'3 of 2023 approves a pay deviation` MEANS FALSE

§§ `נספח ה' — עובדים שתוספת שקלית 2023 שלהם נשארת 400 ש"ח`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1/p3 Signatures and initials on the page; no rule.

-- By §25: the employees whose 2023 shekel supplement does not grow and
-- stays 400 for a full position: (א) administration and maintenance at the
-- Ministry of Health (its hospitals among them), Ichilov and Bnei Zion; (ב)
-- administration and maintenance at Clalit; (ג) medical imaging staff in
-- the State's service, Ichilov, Bnei Zion, Clalit and Hadassah; (ד) medical
-- technologists at the same; (ה) administration and maintenance at
-- Hadassah.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p1 akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_a akn:att_5__hc_1__para_b akn:att_5__hc_1__para_c akn:att_5__hc_1__para_d akn:att_5__hc_1__para_e
`the groups annex ה' of 2023 keeps at 400` MEANS
    LIST "עובדי מנהל ומשק – משרד הבריאות, איכילוב ובני ציון",
         "עובדי מנהל ומשק – קופת חולים כללית",
         "דימותנים רפואיים",
         "טכנולוגים רפואיים",
         "עובדי מנהל ומשק – הדסה"

GIVEN group IS A STRING, `agreed by 1.9.2024 not to grow` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2023 shekel supplement stays at 400 for` group `agreed by 1.9.2024 not to grow` IF
    elem group `the groups annex ה' of 2023 keeps at 400` OR `agreed by 1.9.2024 not to grow`

#ASSERT `the 2023 shekel supplement for a full position on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2025) (`the 2023 shekel supplement stays at 400 for` "טכנולוגים רפואיים" FALSE) EQUALS 400

